// 供 txt.html 等同源阅读器接入主站搜索 UI / 预览（按当前标签页天然隔离）
let _pendingTxtProvider = null;
window.__TXT_SEARCH_BRIDGE__ = {
    register(provider) {
        _pendingTxtProvider = provider || null;
        searchStackReady.then((stack) => {
            if (stack && stack.engine && _pendingTxtProvider === provider) {
                stack.engine.registerTxtProvider(provider);
            }
        });
    },
    unregister(provider) {
        if (!provider || _pendingTxtProvider === provider) _pendingTxtProvider = null;
        searchStackReady.then((stack) => {
            if (stack && stack.engine) stack.engine.unregisterTxtProvider(provider);
        });
    },
    getScope() {
        return searchEngine ? searchEngine.getSearchScope() : 'global';
    },
    setScope(scope, opts = { rerun: true }) {
        searchStackReady.then((stack) => {
            if (stack && stack.engine) stack.engine.setSearchScope(scope, opts);
        });
    }
};
window.__DOC_SEARCH_BRIDGE__ = window.__TXT_SEARCH_BRIDGE__;

// 自愈内核内联保留，确保外部模块损坏时 ?repair=1 与远端指令仍可独立工作
const executeSelfHealing = async (reason, commandId = null) => {
    console.warn(`🚧  触发站点自愈程序: ${reason}`);
    try {
        if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
            const regs = await navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistrations();
            for (const r of regs) await r.unregister();
        }
        if ('caches' in window) {
            const keys = await caches.keys();
            for (const k of keys) await caches.delete(k);
        }
        if (window.indexedDB) {
            dbProxy.close();
            indexedDB.deleteDatabase('MainDB');
            indexedDB.deleteDatabase('BookDB');
        }
        sessionStorage.removeItem("sw_reload_guard");
        sessionStorage.removeItem("ss_restore_strict");
        if (commandId !== null && commandId !== undefined) {
            store.repair_command_id = commandId.toString();
        }
    } catch (e) {
        console.error("自愈过程发生异常", e);
    }
    alert(`🚧 需要进行站点修复。\n[${reason}]`);
    window.location.href = window.location.origin;
};

if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
    navigator.serviceWorker.addEventListener('message', (event) => {
        if (event.data && event.data.type === 'SW_UPDATE_STATUS') {
            sessionStorage.setItem("isUpdate", event.data.isUpdate ? "1" : "0");
        }
    });
}

function clearDataWatchdog() {
    if (window._globalWatchdog) {
        clearTimeout(window._globalWatchdog);
        window._globalWatchdog = null;
    }
}

function armDataWatchdog(ms, reason) {
    clearDataWatchdog();
    window._globalWatchdog = setTimeout(() => {
        window._globalWatchdog = null;
        if (window._dataReady) return;
        console.warn("⚠️ " + reason);
        window._engineError = reason + "（可尝试刷新或访问 ?repair=1 修复）";
        if (searchUI) {
            searchUI.sfPaintStatus(window._currentRenderedKeyword || ($("#searchInput") && $("#searchInput").value) || '');
        }
        if (navigator.onLine && confirm(`⚠️ ${reason}\n\n是否清理浏览器缓存并尝试修复站点？\n（注意：重置将清空本地缓存及快照历史，点“取消”可继续等待）`)) {
            executeSelfHealing(reason);
        }
    }, ms);
}

